  "worked_solution": "We have $\\frac{2}{3}$ on the left and $\\frac{6}{15}$ on the right.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14130839/assets/4134d4b828fd388d27a028fd0bd90cd6fb04f0cb14b8fd3f43da148171773ddc.png)\n\nTherefore, the multiplication problem shown is:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\times \\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{6}{15}\n$$",
